      "purpose": "A database file hex editor module (PVHEXEDT) for IBM i. It compiles as a module and binds with a companion service program (PVHEXEDTU) that provides file interface procedures. It accepts a file/library/member name and a mode parameter, then reads and displays database file records in hexadecimal via a WorkStn display file (Pvhexedtd). It calls external procedures for file open/read/update/close operations and IBM i system APIs (QUSRMBRD, QUSCRTUS, QUSRTVUS, QUSDLTUS, QUSLRCD, QUSLFLD, QsnWrtDta, QCMDEXC) to retrieve member descriptions, manage user spaces, list record formats and fields, and write to the screen.",
